OL,6,
OL,7,FThis article contains distressing
OL,8,Fdetails and references to suicide
OL,10,FA forensic expert has said he believes
OL,11,Fthat convicted sex offender Jeffrey
OL,12,FEpstein's death in prison was the
OL,13,Fresult of a homicide, not suicide.
OL,15,FSpeaking to BBC Newsnight, Professor
OL,16,FMichael Freeman said that after
OL,17,Freviewing the New York City medical
OL,18,Fexaminer's file he believes Epstein was
OL,19,Fstrangled, most likely from behind.
