OL,7,FThe medical examiner who carried out
OL,8,Fthe autopsy concluded in 2019 that
OL,9,FEpstein's injuries were consistent with
OL,10,Fsuicide and there was no evidence of
OL,11,Fthe defensive wounds expected if his
OL,12,Fdeath had been a homicide.
